WEBVTT

00:03:58.116 --> 00:04:01.956
and neighbors who are already
drinking polluted water

00:04:01.996 --> 00:04:03.236
and poisoned water.

00:04:04.476 --> 00:04:07.276
In the midst of a global pandemic,

00:04:07.276 --> 00:04:11.356
multiple uprisings
for racial justice and democracy

00:04:11.396 --> 00:04:14.796
and record wildfires,
droughts and storms --

00:04:14.836 --> 00:04:19.716
it's time we finally realized we can't fix
injustice with more injustice.

00:04:20.316 --> 00:04:22.796
I'll go so far as to say
that frontline communities

00:04:22.836 --> 00:04:25.756
are the only ones
that can get us out of this crisis.

00:04:26.236 --> 00:04:28.116
And in fact, they already are.

00:04:28.476 --> 00:04:32.156
And there's so many great examples,
but to give just one ...